{
  "_hilfe": [
    "Termes techniques suivis dans l'onglet 'Tendances' (aucun lien avec le niveau d'allemand).",
    "Chaque terme : 'name' (affiché) + 'muster' (expressions régulières, insensibles à la casse).",
    "Une offre compte pour un terme si AU MOINS UNE de ses regex apparaît dans le titre ou le texte.",
    "\\b = limite de mot : \\bhorizon\\b trouve 'Horizon' mais pas 'Horizont'.",
    "POUR AJOUTER un terme : copie une ligne et adapte. Il s'applique aussi aux anciennes offres de l'archive.",
    "POUR EN RETIRER un : supprime sa ligne.",
    "groupes : un graphique d'évolution par VOLET d'outils (un outil peut être dans plusieurs volets). Un terme absent des groupes va dans 'Autres'.",
    "ATTENTION : dans du JSON, chaque antislash d'une regex doit être doublé (\\\\b pour \\b)."
  ],

  "themes": [
    {"name": "Kubernetes", "muster": ["kubernetes", "\\bk8s\\b", "\\bk3s\\b"]},
    {"name": "Ansible", "muster": ["\\bansible\\b"]},
    {"name": "Puppet", "muster": ["\\bpuppet\\b"]},
    {"name": "Citrix", "muster": ["\\bcitrix\\b"]},
    {"name": "Horizon", "muster": ["\\bhorizon\\b"]},
    {"name": "Intune", "muster": ["\\bintune\\b"]},
    {"name": "Exchange", "muster": ["\\bexchange\\b"]},
    {"name": "Azure", "muster": ["\\bazure\\b"]},
    {"name": "AWS", "muster": ["\\baws\\b", "amazon web services"]},
    {"name": "CI/CD", "muster": ["\\bci\\s*/\\s*cd\\b", "\\bcicd\\b", "\\bjenkins\\b", "gitlab[\\s-]?ci", "github actions"]},
    {"name": "Terraform", "muster": ["\\bterraform\\b"]},
    {"name": "Linux", "muster": ["\\blinux\\b"]},
    {"name": "VMware", "muster": ["\\bvmware\\b", "\\bvsphere\\b", "\\besxi?\\b", "\\bvcenter\\b"]},
    {"name": "Proxmox", "muster": ["\\bproxmox\\b"]},
    {"name": "Docker", "muster": ["\\bdocker\\b"]},
    {"name": "Prometheus", "muster": ["\\bprometheus\\b"]},
    {"name": "Grafana", "muster": ["\\bgrafana\\b"]},
    {"name": "Checkmk", "muster": ["\\bcheck[\\s_-]?mk\\b"]},
    {"name": "Nagios", "muster": ["\\bnagios\\b"]},
    {"name": "Hyper-V", "muster": ["hyper[\\s-]?v\\b"]},
    {"name": "Google Cloud", "muster": ["google cloud", "\\bgcp\\b"]},
    {"name": "Antivirus", "muster": ["antivir", "virenschutz", "endpoint[\\s-]?(protection|security)", "\\bedr\\b", "\\bxdr\\b", "kaspersky", "sophos", "\\beset\\b", "trend ?micro", "bitdefender", "crowdstrike", "defender for endpoint"]},
    {"name": "Firewall", "muster": ["firewall", "fortinet", "fortigate", "palo ?alto", "check ?point", "pfsense", "opnsense", "watchguard", "sonicwall"]}
  ],

  "groupes": [
    {"name": "DevOps", "termes": ["CI/CD", "Docker", "Kubernetes"]},
    {"name": "Monitoring", "termes": ["Checkmk", "Nagios", "Prometheus", "Grafana"]},
    {"name": "Sécurité", "termes": ["Antivirus", "Firewall"]},
    {"name": "Virtualisation", "termes": ["VMware", "Proxmox", "Hyper-V", "Horizon"]},
    {"name": "Bureau à distance / VDI", "termes": ["Citrix", "Horizon"]},
    {"name": "Cloud", "termes": ["Azure", "AWS", "Google Cloud"]},
    {"name": "Automatisation", "termes": ["Ansible", "Terraform", "Puppet"]},
    {"name": "Linux", "termes": ["Linux"]},
    {"name": "Microsoft", "termes": ["Exchange", "Intune"]}
  ]
}
